<title>NETHERLANDS: Scottish Equitable CEO dies - Aegon.</title>
<headline>Scottish Equitable CEO dies - Aegon.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Insurer Aegon NV said on Wednesday that chief executive officer David Berridge of its British subsidiary Scottish Equitable had died on January 21.</p>
<p>Berridge, 52, joined Scottish Equitable as an actuarial trainee in 1966 and became the life insurer's CEO in 1982.</p>
<p>After Scottish Equitable was taken over by Aegon he was appointed to Aegon's Executive Board in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
